I am in the kitchen now.
All the bags are on my counter.
I take out each item.
I place the rice and dal on the counter.
I like the fresh vegetables very much.
I see the tomatoes and the spinach.
Now I take the spice packets.
These packets are from the small kirana shop.
I have a new masala dabba.
That container is made of steel.
I like that container.
I open the packets.
I put the turmeric and cumin in the container.
The yellow turmeric is very beautiful.
I like the smell.
Now my kitchen is full.
I want to cook my first full dinner.
I want a tasty meal.
Today I am very happy.
